      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELITE DELUXE (4) jumped from box 6 last time and ran away with an impressive win scoring by 4.5 lengths at this track in a handy 22.32. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and two minor placings from four starts. Looks to have an edge on most of these. HELLO CINDY LOU (1) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when second (22.64) at this track in a Grade 1/2. Can turn it around this time. GOLD SMIRCH (8) boasts a strong record this course with nine wins and four minors from 16 tries. Hit the frame latest (17.09) when second at this track in a Free For All. Looks a key chance on best figures. MONKEY MAGIC (2) with some luck can improve on an unplaced run last time here.",
